---
/*
  Sumedha's own hand-drawn wordmark, taken from a screen recording of her
  drawing it.

  It is used as a CSS mask rather than an <img>, so the colour comes from the
  stylesheet instead of being baked into the file. That means the logo inherits
  --red and changes with the palette — the thing the old Big Cartel PNG could
  never do, since it had cream baked into its background and no transparency.

  The aspect ratio matches the artwork (627x240), so the box never distorts it.
*/
---

<span class="mk-logo" role="img" aria-label="Matka Ceramics"></span>

<style>
  .mk-logo {
    display: block;
    height: 38px;
    aspect-ratio: 627 / 240;
    background: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask: url('/wordmark.png') no-repeat center / contain;
    mask: url('/wordmark.png') no-repeat center / contain;
  }
</style>
